{"step_index":104,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T21:48:18Z","thinking":"The `index.html` structure needs thorough review. Navigation elements, including logo, links, cart trigger with dynamic updates, and mobile hamburger menu require confirmation. The hero section content and functionality, such as text, scroll link to menu, WhatsApp order, and badges, must be verified. Ensure inclusion of the announcement strip and promotional category banners.\n\n\nCategory selection requires click handlers for menu filtering; confirm that the handlers update the displayed food items correctly based on the selected category. The expanded menu section's search, filters (veg-only, price sort, and category chips), and dynamic food cards (from the data file) need integration. The cart drawer's functionality, including item manipulation, calculations, special instructions, and \"Proceed to Checkout\" button must be tested.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Brew & Bloom Café – Premium specialty coffee shop & online ordering platform in Haldia, West Bengal. Artisan coffee, handcrafted food, fresh bakes & fast delivery.\" />\n  <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"café Haldia, coffee shop West Bengal, online food ordering Haldia, Brew Bloom Café, artisan coffee, pizza, pasta, desserts delivery\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Brew & Bloom Café | Haldia, West Bengal\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Good Coffee. Slow Moments. Beautiful Days. Order online for instant pickup or fast delivery.\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n  <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#073B32\" />\n  <title>Brew & Bloom Café | Haldia, West Bengal</title>\n\n  <!-- Google Fonts -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n\n  <!-- Leaflet Map CSS -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\" integrity=\"sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=\" crossorigin=\"\" />\n\n  <!-- Custom Stylesheet -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ NAVIGATION ═══════════════════ -->\n  <nav class=\"navbar\" id=\"navbar\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n    <div class=\"nav-container\">\n      <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"nav-logo\" aria-label=\"Brew and Bloom Café home\">\n        <span class=\"logo-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">☕</span>\n        <div class=\"logo-text\">\n          <span class=\"logo-name\">Brew &amp; Bloom</span>\n          <span class=\"logo-tagline\">CAFÉ &amp; KITCHEN</span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n\n      <ul class=\"nav-links\" id=\"navLinks\" role=\"list\">\n        <li><a href=\"#hero\" class=\"nav-link active\">Home</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#menu\" class=\"nav-link\">Menu</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#bestsellers\" class=\"nav-link\">Bestsellers</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#about\" class=\"nav-link\">About</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#gallery\" class=\"nav-link\">Gallery</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#location\" class=\"nav-link\">Find Us</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"order-tracking.html\" class=\"nav-link\">Track Order</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"admin.html\" class=\"nav-link\" style=\"color:var(--golden-yellow);\">Staff/Admin</a></li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <div class=\"nav-actions\">\n        <!-- Cart Trigger Button -->\n        <button class=\"cart-trigger-btn\" id=\"openCartBtn\" aria-label=\"View Shopping Cart\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z\"></path>\n            <line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line>\n            <path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path>\n          </svg>\n          <span>Cart</span>\n          <span class=\"cart-badge\" id=\"navCartBadge\">0</span>\n        </button>\n\n        <button class=\"hamburger\" id=\"hamburger\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"navLinks\">\n          <span class=\"ham-bar\"></span>\n          <span class=\"ham-bar\"></span>\n          <span class=\"ham-bar\"></span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ HERO SECTION ═══════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"hero\" id=\"hero\" aria-label=\"Hero section\">\n    <div class=\"hero-bg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cozy café interior with warm ambient lighting\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">\n      <p class=\"hero-eyebrow\">Freshly Brewed in Haldia, West Bengal</p>\n      <h1 class=\"hero-headline\">\n        Good Coffee.<br />\n        <em>Slow Moments.</em><br />\n        Beautiful Days.\n      </h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-desc\">Artisan single-origin coffees, handcrafted wood-fired pizzas, gourmet pastas and decadent desserts delivered fresh to your door or prepared for dine-in.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n        <a href=\"#menu\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg>\n          Explore Our Menu\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg whatsapp-order\" data-item=\"our chef specials and table booking\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z\"/></svg>\n          Order on WhatsApp\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-badges\">\n        <div class=\"badge\"><span class=\"badge-num\">100%</span><span class=\"badge-label\">Arabica Beans</span></div>\n        <div class=\"badge-sep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"badge\"><span class=\"badge-num\">30 Min</span><span class=\"badge-label\">Avg. Delivery</span></div>\n        <div class=\"badge-sep\"></div>\n        <div class=\"badge\"><span class=\"badge-num\">Open</span><span class=\"badge-label\">7 Days a Week</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-scroll-hint\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <span>scroll</span>\n      <div class=\"scroll-arrow\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ ANNOUNCEMENT STRIP ═══════════════════ -->\n  <div class=\"announcement-strip\" role=\"marquee\" aria-live=\"off\">\n    <div class=\"strip-track\">\n      <span>☕ Single-Origin Arabica &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🍕 Artisan Wood-Fired Pizza &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🍝 Creamy Handcrafted Pastas &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🍰 Molten Lava Cakes &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🛵 Real-Time Live Order Tracking &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🌿 Pure Vegetarian Options &nbsp;·&nbsp;</span>\n      <span aria-hidden=\"true\">☕ Single-Origin Arabica &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🍕 Artisan Wood-Fired Pizza &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🍝 Creamy Handcrafted Pastas &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🍰 Molten Lava Cakes &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🛵 Real-Time Live Order Tracking &nbsp;·&nbsp; 🌿 Pure Vegetarian Options &nbsp;·&nbsp;</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ CATEGORY PROMO BANNERS ═══════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"promo-banners-section\" aria-label=\"Signature Highlights\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"promo-grid\">\n        <!-- Pizza Banner -->\n        <a href=\"#menu\" class=\"promo-card\" data-category=\"pizza\">\n          <div class=\"promo-card-bg\" style=\"background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513104890138-7c749659a591?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80');\"></div>\n          <div class=\"promo-card-overlay\"></div>\n          <span class=\"promo-tag\">Fresh from Oven</span>\n          <div class=\"promo-card-content\">\n            <h3 class=\"promo-card-title\">Artisan Pizzas</h3>\n            <p class=\"promo-card-sub\">Wood-fired thin crust &amp; mozzarella</p>\n            <span class=\"promo-card-cta\">Order Now →</span>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n\n        <!-- Pasta Banner -->\n        <a href=\"#menu\" class=\"promo-card\" data-category=\"pizza\">\n          <div class=\"promo-card-bg\" style=\"background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621996346565-e3d5d628169e?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80');\"></div>\n          <div class=\"promo-card-overlay\"></div>\n          <span class=\"promo-tag\">Chef Special</span>\n          <div class=\"promo-card-content\">\n            <h3 class=\"promo-card-title\">Handcrafted Pasta</h3>\n            <p class=\"promo-card-sub\">Velvety Alfredo &amp; spiced Arrabbiata</p>\n            <span class=\"promo-card-cta\">Order Now →</span>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n\n        <!-- Smoothies Banner -->\n        <a href=\"#menu\" class=\"promo-card\" data-category=\"cold\">\n          <div class=\"promo-card-bg\" style=\"background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553530666-ba11a7da3888?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80');\"></div>\n          <div class=\"promo-card-overlay\"></div>\n          <span class=\"promo-tag\">Cool &amp; Fresh</span>\n          <div class=\"promo-card-content\">\n            <h3 class=\"promo-card-title\">Frappes &amp; Shakes</h3>\n            <p class=\"promo-card-sub\">Blended fruits, cream &amp; Oreos</p>\n            <span class=\"promo-card-cta\">Order Now →</span>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n\n        <!-- Desserts Banner -->\n        <a href=\"#menu\" class=\"promo-card\" data-category=\"desserts\">\n          <div class=\"promo-card-bg\" style=\"background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578985545062-69928b1d9587?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80');\"></div>\n          <div class=\"promo-card-overlay\"></div>\n          <span class=\"promo-tag\">Sweet Indulgence</span>\n          <div class=\"promo-card-content\">\n            <h3 class=\"promo-card-title\">Warm Desserts</h3>\n            <p class=\"promo-card-sub\">Lava cakes, brownies &amp; cheesecakes</p>\n            <span class=\"promo-card-cta\">Order Now →</span>\n          </div>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ MAIN FOOD MENU ═══════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"section menu-section\" id=\"menu\" aria-labelledby=\"menu-heading\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Fresh &amp; Flavourful</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"menu-heading\">Explore Our Food &amp; Brews</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-desc\">Every dish and beverage is prepared fresh to order. Customize your cravings, add to cart, and enjoy seamless delivery right to your door.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Menu Search, Filters & Sorting Toolbar -->\n      <div class=\"menu-toolbar\">\n        <div class=\"menu-search-sort-row\">\n          <!-- Search Box -->\n          <div class=\"menu-search-box\">\n            <span class=\"search-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</span>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"menuSearchInput\" class=\"menu-search-input\" placeholder=\"Search coffee, pizza, pasta, shakes, fries...\" aria-label=\"Search menu items\" />\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Controls: Veg Toggle & Sort -->\n          <div class=\"menu-filter-controls\">\n            <label class=\"veg-toggle-label\" for=\"vegOnlyToggle\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"vegOnlyToggle\" style=\"accent-color: #27AE60;\" />\n              <span class=\"veg-icon-badge\"><span class=\"veg-icon-dot\"></span></span>\n              <span>Veg Only</span>\n            </label>\n\n            <select id=\"menuSortSelect\" class=\"sort-select\" aria-label=\"Sort menu items\">\n              <option value=\"default\">Featured Sort</option>\n              <option value=\"bestseller\">⭐ Bestsellers First</option>\n              <option value=\"price-low\">Price: Low to High</option>\n              <option value=\"price-high\">Price: High to Low</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Category Filter Chips -->\n        <div class=\"menu-category-chips\" id=\"categoryChipsContainer\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Menu categories\">\n          <!-- Rendered dynamically from menu-data.js -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Food Menu Grid (Dynamically rendered) -->\n      <div class=\"dynamic-menu-grid\" id=\"menuGridContainer\">\n        <!-- Rendered by script.js -->\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:2.5rem;\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--text-muted); background:var(--white); padding:0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius:100px; display:inline-block; border:1px solid var(--border-light);\">\n          📝 <em>All items and prices are editable from <code>js/menu-data.js</code>. Demo prices in Indian Rupees (₹).</em>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ BESTSELLERS (Dark Forest Green) ═══════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"section bestsellers-section\" id=\"bestsellers\" aria-labelledby=\"bestsellers-heading\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Crowd Favourites</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"bestsellers-heading\">Customer Bestsellers</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-desc\">The standout culinary stars that our Haldia guests keep ordering again and again.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bestsellers-grid\">\n        <!-- 1 -->\n        <article class=\"bestseller-card\">\n          <div class=\"bestseller-img-wrap\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ae38?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Paneer Tikka Pizza\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <div class=\"bestseller-rank\">#1 Pizza</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bestseller-body\">\n            <h3>Paneer Tikka Pizza</h3>\n            <p>Smoky tandoori paneer, bell peppers, mozzarella &amp; makhani reduction</p>\n            <div class=\"bestseller-footer\">\n              <span class=\"bestseller-price\">₹360</span>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary add-to-cart-direct\" data-id=\"paneer-tikka-pizza\">+ Add to Cart</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <!-- 2 -->\n        <article class=\"bestseller-card\">\n          <div class=\"bestseller-img-wrap\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621996346565-e3d5d628169e?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"White Sauce Pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <div class=\"bestseller-rank\">#2 Pasta</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bestseller-body\">\n            <h3>White Sauce Pasta</h3>\n            <p>Silky parmesan alfredo sauce, sautéed mushrooms, herbs &amp; broccoli</p>\n            <div class=\"bestseller-footer\">\n              <span class=\"bestseller-price\">₹240</span>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary add-to-cart-direct\" data-id=\"white-sauce-pasta\">+ Add to Cart</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <!-- 3 -->\n        <article class=\"bestseller-card\">\n          <div class=\"bestseller-img-wrap\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1617305855058-336d24456869?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Chocolate Lava Cake\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <div class=\"bestseller-rank\">#3 Dessert</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bestseller-body\">\n            <h3>Chocolate Lava Cake</h3>\n            <p>Warm decadent cake with streaming molten Belgian chocolate centre</p>\n            <div class=\"bestseller-footer\">\n              <span class=\"bestseller-price\">₹160</span>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary add-to-cart-direct\" data-id=\"chocolate-lava-cake\">+ Add to Cart</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <!-- 4 -->\n        <article class=\"bestseller-card\">\n          <div class=\"bestseller-img-wrap\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Oreo Shake\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <div class=\"bestseller-rank\">#4 Shake</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bestseller-body\">\n            <h3>Oreo Shake</h3>\n            <p>Creamy vanilla ice cream churned with whole crunchy Oreo cookies</p>\n            <div class=\"bestseller-footer\">\n              <span class=\"bestseller-price\">₹180</span>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary add-to-cart-direct\" data-id=\"oreo-shake\">+ Add to Cart</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ ABOUT SECTION ═══════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"section about-section\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-heading\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"about-grid\">\n        <div class=\"about-imagery\">\n          <div class=\"about-img-main\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Café seating ambiance with plants\"></div>\n          <div class=\"about-img-accent\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pouring latte art\"></div>\n          <div class=\"about-stat-card\">\n            <span class=\"stat-num\">5+</span>\n            <span class=\"stat-label\">Years of Craft</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"about-content\">\n          <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Our Story</p>\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"about-heading\">Where Every Cup &amp; Dish Tells a Story</h2>\n          <p class=\"about-para\">Brew &amp; Bloom Café was founded with a clear passion — to bring world-class specialty coffee roasting and gourmet artisan dining to Haldia, West Bengal. We believe food should be unhurried, genuine, and shared with those who matter most.</p>\n          <p class=\"about-para\">From ethically sourced Arabica beans to authentic hand-rolled pizza dough fermented over 24 hours, our culinary team pours uncompromised dedication into every recipe.</p>\n\n          <div class=\"about-values\">\n            <div class=\"value-item\">\n              <span class=\"value-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🫘</span>\n              <div>\n                <strong>Direct-Trade Arabica Beans</strong>\n                <p>Ethically roasted in micro-batches for optimum flavour</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"value-item\">\n              <span class=\"value-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🍕</span>\n              <div>\n                <strong>Handcrafted In-House Daily</strong>\n                <p>Authentic pizzas, gourmet pastas &amp; fresh bakes made from scratch</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"value-item\">\n              <span class=\"value-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛵</span>\n              <div>\n                <strong>Fast &amp; Insulated Delivery</strong>\n                <p>Food stays piping hot and fresh with real-time GPS tracking</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <a href=\"#menu\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Order Delicious Food</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ PHOTO GALLERY (Dark Espresso) ═══════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"section gallery-section\" id=\"gallery\" aria-labelledby=\"gallery-heading\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Visual Tour</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"gallery-heading\">Moments at Brew &amp; Bloom</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-desc\">Step inside our warm, plant-filled sanctuary and peek into our bustling kitchen.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"gallery-grid\" role=\"list\">\n        <div class=\"gallery-item gallery-tall\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <img class=\"gallery-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554118811-1e0d58224f24?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Cozy café corner seating\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <div class=\"gallery-overlay\">\n            <span class=\"gallery-label\">The Bloom Reading Corner</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"gallery-item\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <img class=\"gallery-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1510591509098-f4fdc6d0ff04?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Artisan espresso pull\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <div class=\"gallery-overlay\">\n            <span class=\"gallery-label\">The Perfect Pull</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"gallery-item\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <img class=\"gallery-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513104890138-7c749659a591?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Freshly baked pizza\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <div class=\"gallery-overlay\">\n            <span class=\"gallery-label\">Wood-Fired Crust</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"gallery-item gallery-wide\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <img class=\"gallery-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Sunlit café tables\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <div class=\"gallery-overlay\">\n            <span class=\"gallery-label\">Golden Morning Light</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"gallery-item\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <img class=\"gallery-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Chilled frappes\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <div class=\"gallery-overlay\">\n            <span class=\"gallery-label\">Artisan Coolers</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"gallery-item\" role=\"listitem\">\n          <img class=\"gallery-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606313564200-e75d5e30476c?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80\" alt=\"Warm brownies and cakes\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          <div class=\"gallery-overlay\">\n            <span class=\"gallery-label\">Decadent Bakes</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ LOCATION & HOURS ═══════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"section location-section\" id=\"location\" aria-labelledby=\"location-heading\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Visit or Order</p>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"location-heading\">Location &amp; Opening Hours</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-desc\">Located in the vibrant core of Haldia. Drop by for a slow coffee or order hot meals to your doorstep.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"location-grid\">\n        <div class=\"location-info\">\n          <div class=\"info-card\">\n            <div class=\"info-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📍</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3>Café Address</h3>\n              <p>[Sample Address], Near City Center,<br />Haldia, West Bengal – 721657</p>\n              <small style=\"color:var(--vibrant-orange); font-size:0.75rem;\">📝 Configurable in <code>js/config.js</code></small>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"info-card\">\n            <div class=\"info-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🕐</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3>Kitchen &amp; Café Hours</h3>\n              <div class=\"hours-grid\">\n                <span>Mon – Fri:</span><span>8:00 AM – 9:00 PM</span>\n                <span>Saturday:</span><span>8:00 AM – 10:00 PM</span>\n                <span>Sunday:</span><span>9:00 AM – 8:00 PM</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"info-card\">\n            <div class=\"info-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📞</div>\n            <div>\n              <h3>Direct Contacts</h3>\n              <p>Phone: <a href=\"tel:+910000000000\" style=\"color:var(--vibrant-orange); font-weight:700;\">+91 00000 00000</a></p>\n              <p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:hello@brewandbloom.in\">hello@brewandbloom.in</a></p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;\">\n            <a href=\"order-tracking.html\" class=\"btn btn-golden\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n              🛵 Check Live Order Tracking Demo\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Interactive Leaflet Map for Haldia Café Location -->\n        <div class=\"map-container\">\n          <div id=\"locationLeafletMap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Interactive map of Brew & Bloom Café in Haldia\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═══════════════════ FOOTER ═══════════════════ -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n        <div>\n          <a href=\"#hero\" class=\"nav-logo\" aria-label=\"Brew and Bloom Café home\">\n            <span class=\"logo-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">☕</span>\n            <div class=\"logo-text\">\n              <span class=\"logo-name\">Brew &amp; Bloom</span>\n              <span class=\"logo-tagline\">CAFÉ &amp; KITCHEN</span>\n            </div>\n          </a>\n          <p class=\"footer-brand-desc\">Good Coffee. Slow Moments. Beautiful Days. Serving premium specialty beverages and comforting culinary dishes in Haldia, West Bengal.</p>\n          <div class=\"social-links\" aria-label=\"Social media links\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"social-link whatsapp-order\" data-item=\"general enquiry\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\">\n              <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.