{"step_index":106,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T21:48:55Z","thinking":"The `script.js` file requires imports from several modules. These imports include configuration settings, menu data like items and categories, cart functionality such as adding and removing items, and functions related to order placement and database initialization. It looks like the script is orchestrating interactions between these different modules to manage the application's core logic.\n\n\nThe application logic likely involves data fetching from a database, using configurations for WhatsApp links and restaurant details. Rendering the menu grid integrates data with UI elements, including image handling with emoji fallbacks and interactive \"Add to Cart\" buttons that react to quantity changes. Filtering and sorting functionalities respond to user input and selection, dynamically updating the displayed menu.\n\nThe cart drawer manages item additions, removals, and quantity adjustments, calculating order totals and handling special instructions. The checkout modal includes a delivery/takeaway/dine-in mode switcher that impacts delivery fees. Geolocation integration estimates the delivery distance, using the device's location to determine service availability and dynamically update UI elements based on proximity. Form validation ensures that the entered data meets specific format criteria for a successful transaction.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n * ║  BREW & BLOOM CAFÉ — MAIN APPLICATION ENGINE            ║\n * ║  Handles menu rendering, category filtering, search,    ║\n * ║  shopping cart drawer, checkout modal, Leaflet map,     ║\n * ║  and order placement.                                   ║\n * ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n */\n\nimport CONFIG from './js/config.js';\nimport { CATEGORIES, CATEGORY_BANNERS, MENU_ITEMS, searchAndFilterItems, getItemById } from './js/menu-data.js';\nimport { addItem, decreaseItem, removeItem, clearCart, subscribe as subscribeCart, getQty, getSnapshot, estimateDeliveryTime } from './js/cart.js';\nimport { initSupabase, placeOrder, DEMO_MODE } from './js/supabase-client.js';\n\n// Application State\nconst state = {\n  currentCategory: 'all',\n  searchQuery: '',\n  sortOrder: 'default',\n  vegOnly: false,\n  deliveryMode: 'delivery', // 'delivery' | 'takeaway' | 'dinein'\n  customerLat: CONFIG.restaurant.lat,\n  customerLng: CONFIG.restaurant.lng,\n  customerDistanceKm: 2.5, // default reasonable distance in Haldia\n  checkoutMap: null,\n  checkoutUserMarker: null,\n  checkoutRouteLayer: null,\n};\n\n/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n   TOAST NOTIFICATION ENGINE\n   ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════